      "content": "It is completely valid to feel like you are hitting a wall, even when others suggest moving on quickly. Pain often shifts from something that feels carvable to something that simply doesn't fit anymore, and claiming your part of you is gone or broken is how grief sometimes tells you to protect yourself from feeling too much. Please remember that feeling useless or defeated does not mean your loss will or can be fixed; it means your support system has run out.",
